ked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: Godot 4.7.2\n\n### System information\n\nmacOS 26\n\n### Issue description\n\nOpening Find in Files brings the editor window to front when it should only show the search window on top of whatever you have open. For example, working with the Script Editor as a separate window will bring the editor to the front, occluding the script editor. This is bad user experience and now you are wondering what happened and where your window is\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen the Script Editor, click \"make the script editor floating\" to open it in a separate window (which is wrongly named floating, it's not a floating window, it's just a separate window), press Command + Shift + F and the Script Editor \"will disappear\", since the editor is brought to the front instead of just the search window.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n- Not needed. Any project will do.","closed_by":{"login":"lexum0","id":2546522,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1NDY1MjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2546522?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lexum0","html_url":"https://github.com/lexum0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lexum0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lexum0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lexum0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lexum0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lexum0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lexum0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lexum0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lexum0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lexum0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122754/reactio